>>__ Parse.temp_set_grammars $ valOf $ grammarDB {thyname="hol"};
## `linarith_solver_with_facts`

``` hol4
linarithLib.linarith_solver_with_facts : thm list -> TraverseExt.ssolver
```

------------------------------------------------------------------------

Provides `linarith_solver` with an explicit list of `[arith]` facts.

`linarith_solver_with_facts facts` is the solver
[`linarith_solver`](#linarithLib.linarith_solver) whose facts are exactly
`facts`: the global `[arith]` set is not read, whatever
it holds.

### Failure

As for [`linarith_solver`](#linarithLib.linarith_solver).

### See also

[`linarithLib.linarith_solver`](#linarithLib.linarith_solver),
[`linarithLib.LINARITH_ext_ss_with`](#linarithLib.LINARITH_ext_ss_with),
[`linarithData.arith`](#linarithData.arith)
